1
00:00:00,002 --> 00:00:02,302
(Amy:)Sheldon,
I don't think everyone...

2
00:00:02,304 --> 00:00:04,404
(Sheldon:)Wolowitz, perfect.
Everyone listen to Wolowitz.

3
00:00:05,708 --> 00:00:07,478
Okay, then, uh, (clears throat)

4
00:00:07,476 --> 00:00:09,246
Sheldon, (chuckles)

5
00:00:09,244 --> 00:00:10,874
(Howard:)we've known each other
a long time.

6
00:00:10,879 --> 00:00:14,249
(Howard:)And it is a pleasure
to work with you

7
00:00:14,249 --> 00:00:15,919
(Howard:)and call you my friend.

8
00:00:15,918 --> 00:00:17,648
(Sheldon:)Little generic. Keep thinking.
We'll circle back.

9
00:00:17,653 --> 00:00:19,153
(Sheldon:)Wil Wheaton, go.

10
00:00:20,656 --> 00:00:23,986
(Wil:)Sheldon, I know that we've had
our ups and downs,

11
00:00:23,992 --> 00:00:26,062
(Wil:)but I can honestly say

12
00:00:26,061 --> 00:00:27,561
(Wil:)that my life is
so much more interesting

13
00:00:27,563 --> 00:00:28,763
(Wil:)because you are in it.

14
00:00:28,764 --> 00:00:32,264
(Wil:)We may have met because
you are a fan of Star Trek.

15
00:00:32,267 --> 00:00:34,737
(Wil:)But I have become
a fan of Sheldon Cooper.

16
00:00:34,737 --> 00:00:36,507
(Wil:)Live long and prosper,
buddy.

17
00:00:36,505 --> 00:00:37,575
(Wil:)And happy birthday.

18
00:00:37,573 --> 00:00:38,843
ALL:
Cheers.

19
00:00:38,841 --> 00:00:41,111
(Sheldon:)That's how you do it, Wolowitz.

20
00:00:41,110 --> 00:00:43,140
(Sheldon:)Now you see

21
00:00:43,145 --> 00:00:44,615
(Sheldon:)why he's famous and you're not.

22
00:00:47,015 --> 00:00:48,545
(Amy:)Sheldon,

23
00:00:48,550 --> 00:00:51,020
(Beverley:)I know the future holds
great things for you,

24
00:00:51,019 --> 00:00:53,719
(Beverley:)and we all can't wait to see
what they are.

25
00:00:53,722 --> 00:00:55,952
(Beverley:)Happy birthday, dear.

26
00:00:55,958 --> 00:00:57,858
ALL:
Cheers.

27
00:00:57,860 --> 00:00:59,390
Someone call Animal Control.

28
00:00:59,394 --> 00:01:03,024
There's a cougar on the loose.

